abstract: >-
  Corrected exploratory store-and-forward fabric simulation, reproducible
  equal-resource topology comparisons, assumption-driven capacity bounds and
  a proposed compute-near-HBM accelerator architecture. Software and synthetic
  simulation results do not establish implemented hardware performance,
  full-system energy efficiency or physical feasibility.
